# Indflix Project Rules

## Code style
- Comments very sparse: only when code is not self-explanatory. Prefer none.
- One short line max. No doc blocks, no paragraphs.
- No names of developers, plugins, sites, or titles; state only what the code does.
- Simple and direct beats clever: no unnecessary abstractions, wrappers, or helpers.
- Do not over complicate coding/programming if not sure take refernce on internet or ask.

## Architecture
- Do not create unnecessary files: related logic lives in one file and one object.
- Use logic in creating file and naming them.
